/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (The diagram shows users \(such as the CEO, users with Read / Write access and portal users\) accessing the application, which contains forms and data, security and permissions \(user permissions, roles and data sharing\) and customisation items. The governance features \(user permissions, roles, data sharing and portal user permissions\) manage and control access to the application. The key outcomes are data security through controlled access, role-based access, safe collaboration through data sharing, and efficient management. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
