<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (The experiment therefore shows the access-control tools that Zoho Creator offers: permission sets decide what a user can do, roles decide which records a user can see, and data sharing rules extend visibility with a chosen access level. Controlling who can access application data, and at what level, remains an essential part of building and managing business applications. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
