/Title (Because a user's role decides which records the user can see, the Manager and employee roles allow records to be viewed according to their position under the CEO. The Add Permission option opens the Add Permission Set panel shown in Figure 4. The panel asks for a Name and a Description, offers an expandable API & Security Permission section, and lists the modules Job Application and dashboard with)
